{"ticker":"POLYPLEX","symbol":"POLYPLEX","instrumentId":3023102,"name":"Polyplex Corpn.","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Plastics","about":"Polyplex Corporation Ltd. is a prominent manufacturer of polyester films, primarily Biaxially Oriented Polyethylene Terephthalate (BOPET) films, in India. The company specializes in producing high-quality films used in packaging, labeling, and electrical applications. With state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities and a commitment to sustainability, Polyplex focuses on minimizing its environmental impact through efficient production processes and the use of recycled materials. The company serves a diverse clientele across various sectors, including food packaging, pharmaceuticals, and consumer goods. Polyplex's dedication to innovation and quality ensures that its products meet international standards, making it a trusted partner in the global packaging industry.","website":"www.polyplex.com","location":"Distt Udham Singh Nagar, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:49:33.993Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":989.3,"changePct":0.22287508864349426,"week52High":1229.6,"week52Low":747.8},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹3,106 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹8,131 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"22,916,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"89"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"4,006,585"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.31%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.75"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"4.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.07"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.09"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-37%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"13.45"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"11–290"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"1.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"171.01"},{"label":"Volume","value":"58,274"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"65,048"},{"label":"Master score","value":"73"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"65"},{"lab